#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/about.md
msgid "If you have contributed to F-Droid and your name is missing, it’s a mistake and you should [add yourself to the list](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/blob/master/_data/contributors.yaml)! Please include your Weblate username if you are a translator.  Keep it sorted by first name, please."
msgstr "Parte hartu baduzu eta zure izena falta bada akats bat da, [gehitu zure burua zerrendara](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/blob/master/_data/contributors.yaml)! Itzultzailea bazara jarri ere zure Weblateko erabiltzaile-izena. Izenez ordenatuta mantendu mesedez."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _pages/consulting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Consulting"
msgstr "Aholkularitza"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/consulting.md
msgid "If you're running an organisation that uses F-Droid or would like to use F-Droid, you will sometimes want to have an expert. This page is a list of companies and developers who contributed to F-Droid in one way or another and are available for consulting. By contracting one of these companies or developers, your organisation can also (indirectly) support the development of F-Droid."
msgstr "F-Droid darabilen edo erabili nahi duen elkarte bat baduzu, aditu bat nahi zenezake. Orri hau moduren batean F-Droid-en parte hartu duten eta aholkularitza emateko prest enpresa eta garatzaileen zerrenda bat da. Enpresa edo garatzaile hauetakoren bat kontratatuz, zure erakundeak zeharka F-Droid lagundu dezake."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/consulting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that the F-Droid ecosystem consists of several components. Thus, consulting services may offer a lot of different services, such as\n"
"  * Deployment of F-Droid within an organisation\n"
"  * Setup and maintenance of F-Droid repositories\n"
"  * Workshops for users and admins\n"
"  * Help in getting an app compliant for inclusion in the main f-droid.org repository\n"
"  * Bug fixes or feature additions to the F-Droid client and server components\n"
"  * Whitelabel solutions\n"
msgstr ""
"Kontuan izan F-Droid ekosistemak hainbat osagai dituela. Beraz, ahaolkulariek denetariko zerbitzuak eskaini ditzakete, hala noa\n"
"  * F-Droid elkartean ezartzea\n"
"  * F-Droid biltegiak ezari eta mantentzea\n"
"  * Erabiltzaile eta kudeatzaileentzako tailerrak\n"
"  * Aplikazioa fdroid.org biltegi nagusian sartzeko bateragarri bihurtzeko laguntza\n"
"  * Akatsen konponketa edo ezaugarriak gehitzea F-Droid bezeroan eta zerbitzariaren osagaietan\n"
"  * Marka zuriko irtenbideak\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/consulting.md
msgid "Check out the descriptions to find an appropriate consultant for your needs."
msgstr "Egiaztatu deskripzioak zure beharretarako aholkulari egokia aurkitzeko."

