msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to donate"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "We recommend using donation platforms like [**Liberapay**](https://liberapay.com/F-Droid-Data/ \"https://liberapay.com/F-Droid-Data/\") or [**Open Collective**](https://opencollective.com/f-droid/ \"https://opencollective.com/f-droid/\"). These free software, community-driven donation platforms, support low-fee and transparent donations."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "You can support F-Droid via monthly recurring donations or with one-time gifts."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Monthly donations keep F-Droid sustainable. By setting up a recurring monthly donation, you create a dependable funding stream that helps us plan ahead, support development initiatives and maintain essential services without interruptions."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "The small gift of €5/month, when multiplied by thousands of supporters, results in a reliable funding stream for maintenance, innovation, security and outreach programs. Donors that support us on a recurring basis are key allies, helping us realize F-Droid's core mission - fighting for software freedom and privacy protection. Your recurring support empowers long term impact that one-time donations can't match."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
