#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Issues"
msgstr "Arazoak"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you come across an issue regarding F-Droid, please report it to the related issue tracker."
msgstr "F-Droid-i buruzko arazo bat aurkitzen baduzu, mesedez jakinarazi dagokion arazo kudeatzailean."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client App"
msgstr "Bezero appa"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you’re having a problem with the F-Droid client application (our app store app), please check if we already know about it, and/or report it in [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues)."
msgstr "F-Droid bezero-aplikazioarekin (gure app biltegiaren aplikazioa) arazo bat izaten ari bazara, egiaztatu ezazu ea dagoeneko horren berri badugun eta hala ez bada sortu auzi bat [bezeroko auzientzako atalean](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "App Data"
msgstr "Apparen datuak"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For problems related to the contents of the F-Droid repository (the apps in our app store), such as a disappeared or outdated applications, please use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/issues)."
msgstr "F-Droid biltegiko edukiekin (gure dendako aplikazioak) lotutako arazoak badituzu, esaterako desagertutako edo zaharkitutako aplikazioak, mesedez erabili [arazoen kudeatzaile hau](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/issues)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Request for Packaging"
msgstr "Pakete berrien eskariak"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "To request a new application to be packaged (add an app to our app store), please, first check the app data issue tracker to see if that application was available in the past and got removed. Any remaining request for packaging (RFP) can be added to [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/-/issues/)."
msgstr "Aplikazio berri bat paketatzea eskatzeko (aplikazioa gure dendara gehitzea), mesedez lehenengo egiaztatu aplikazioen datuen arazoen kudeatzailea, aplikazioa aurrez eskuragarri egon eta kendu zen ikusteko. Gainerako paketatze eskaerak (RFP) [arazoen kudeatzaile honetan](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/-/issues/) gehitu daitezke."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server Tools"
msgstr "Zerbitzariko tresnak"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues on the server tools (building apps yourself or running your own repo), please use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/issues)."
msgstr "Zerbitzariko tresnei dagozkien arazoetarako (zuk zeuk aplikazioak konpilatzean edo zure biltegia sortzean), erabili mesedez [zerbitzariko auzientzako atala](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/issues)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Website"
msgstr "Webgunea"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues relating to this web site, you can use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/issues)."
msgstr "Webgune honekin lotura duten auzien berri emateko [webguneko eskarien atala](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/issues) erabil dezakezu."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Website Search"
msgstr "Webgunean bilatu"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues relating to https://search.f-droid.org or search results in this website, you can use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website-search/issues)."
msgstr "https://search.f-droid.org webgunearekin edo bertako bilaketekin lotura duten auzien berri emateko [webguneko eskarien atala](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/issues) erabil dezakezu."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Fire Hose"
msgstr "Botika-kutxa"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you have not found the right place, try searching through [all of the issues](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues/)  tracked by the F-Droid project."
msgstr "Ez baduzu leku egokia aurkitu, saiatu F-Droid proiektuaren [arazo guztietan](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues/) bilatzen."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repomaker"
msgstr "Repomaker"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "F-Droid.org is just a repo out of hundreds of repos created by individuals all around the globe. With the tools of F-Droid, everyone can create their own repo. So whether you are a musician who wants to publish their music or a developer who wants to serve nightly builds of their app, you are free to create your own repo and share it with other people independently of F-Droid.org."
msgstr "F-Droid.org mundu osoko banakakoek sortutako ehunka biltegien arteko beste biltegi bat besterik ez da, F-Droid tresnekin edonork sortu dezake bere biltegia. Bere musika argitaratu nahi duen musikari bat bazara zein gaueroko konpilazioak argitaratu nahi dituen garatzaile bat bazara, F-Droid.org-etik independentea den zure biltegia sortu eta partekatzeko askatasuna duzu."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "In the past, creating a repo has been difficult because you had to have knowledge on the command line, needed to edit text files to edit your packages' store details and had to paste screenshots in a special system of directories to have them served well inside the F-Droid app."
msgstr "Iraganean, biltegi bat sortzea zaila zen komando lerroaren ezagutza behar zenuelako, testu fitxategiak editatu behar ziren zure paketearen xehetasunak aldatzeko eta pantaila-argazkiak sistemako karpeta berezietan sartu behar ziren F-Droid aplikazioan behar bezala agertu zitezen."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "This all got easier now: with Repomaker, you are able to create your own repo and do not need to have any special knowledge to do so.  Check out the [installation guide](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker/blob/master/README.md#installation)  for information on how you can install Repomaker on your device."
msgstr "Hau orain errazagoa da: Repomaker erabilita zure biltegia sortu dezakezu ezagutza berezirik behar gabe. Begiratu  [instalazio gida](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker/blob/master/README.md#installation) Repomaker zure gailuan instalatzeko argibideetarako."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/repo-details.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/repo-details.png %})<br/>\n"
"*Your repo can serve all types of media*\n"
msgstr ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/repo-details.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/repo-details.png %})<br/>\n"
"*Zure biltegiak edozelako multimedia edukia zerbitzatu dezake*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/package-details.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/package-details.png %})<br/>\n"
"*Editing your package store details never was easier*\n"
msgstr ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/package-details.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/package-details.png %})<br/>\n"
"*Zure paketearen xehetasunak aldatzea inoiz baino errazagoa da*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/create-repo.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/create-repo.png %})<br/>\n"
