msgstr ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/create-repo.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/create-repo.png %})<br/>\n"
"*Biltegi bat sortzeko bi klik besterik ez dira behar*\n"

#. type: Plain text
